msgid "An offer can only be accepted in a customer account. Once the guest has an account, assign the request to it; then create the offer. The name, e-mail address and company of the guest are removed from the request, the account holds them. Check that the account belongs to the guest: the shop does not confirm e-mail addresses at registration."
